  "solution": "**Given: **If 66 # 4 = 12.4 and 12 # 82 = -14\n\nThe logic followed here is:\n\n**Logic:** a # b = (a − b) ÷ 5\n\n66 # 4 = 12.4 → (66 - 4) ÷ 5 = 62 ÷ 5 = 12.4\n\n12 # 82 = (12 − 82) ÷ 5 = −70 ÷ 5 = −14\n\nSimilarly,\n\n81 # 14 = (81 − 14) ÷ 5 = 67 ÷ 5 = 13.4\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**Option 3**\".",
